  "description": "PUWHEV crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C72 H144 Mn4 N8 O40 Tb4,2(C2 H3 N1),0.5(C7 H8). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Mn1 (Mn) has 5 O neighbors; Mn2 (Mn) has 5 O neighbors; Mn3 (Mn) has 5 O neighbors; Mn4 (Mn) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.368-3.973 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 97.51-116.07°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C72H144Mn4N8O40Tb4·2(C2H3N)·0.5(C7H8). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)). Article name explicitly identifies Mn(III), Tb(III).",
